
@startuml

' بداية العملية
|Librarian|
start
:Receive the returned copy;
:Scan the copy;

' التحقق من أن النسخة في حالة إعارة
|System|
if (Is the copy on loan?) then (yes)

  :Find the corresponding loan;
  :Close the loan;

  ' التحقق من التأخير
  if (Is the return late?) then (yes)

    :Activate extension point late return;
    :Suspend the member;

  else (no)
    :Continue the return process;
  endif

  ' التحقق من الحجز
  if (Is the copy reserved?) then (yes)

    :Keep the copy aside;
    :Notify the member who reserved it;

  else (no)
    :Make the copy available;
  endif

  ' طباعة وصل الإرجاع
  :Print the return receipt;

  |Librarian|
  :Confirm the return;

else (no)

  :Display an error message;

endif

stop
@enduml
